<link rel="stylesheet" href="/workforce.css">
<div class="workforce"><div class="wf-shell"><section class="wf-hero"><div><div class="wf-kicker">SV Personnel / Workforce services</div><h1>Find the right<br><em>help for the job.</em></h1><p>Discover local professionals for your home, or find staff for your business.</p>
<form class="wf-search" action="/discover"><label>Service<input name="skill" placeholder="e.g. Cleaning"></label><label>Location<input data-free-city name="city" placeholder="City or area"></label><button>Search →</button></form></div>
<aside><h2>Hiring a team?</h2><p>Tell us the role, headcount and location. Start with the hiring option that fits.</p><a href="/staffing?type=permanent">Permanent staff <span>↗</span></a><a href="/staffing?type=corporate">Corporate staffing <span>↗</span></a></aside></section>
<section><h2>Explore services</h2><div class="wf-list"><% homeContent.ottCategories.forEach(cat=>{ %><details><summary><%= cat.title.replace(/^\d+\.\s*/, '') %></summary><div><% cat.items.forEach(item=>{ %><a href="/discover?skill=<%= encodeURIComponent(item.name) %>"><%= item.name %></a> <% }) %></div></details><% }) %></div></section><% if(homeContent.testimonials.length){ %><section><h2>Customer reviews</h2><% homeContent.testimonials.forEach(review=>{ %><blockquote><p><%= review.quote %></p><cite><%= review.name %></cite></blockquote><% }) %></section><% } %>
<section><h2>Work with SV Personnel</h2><a href="/register/professional">Register as a professional →</a> · <a href="/partner/register">Become an agency partner →</a></section></div></div>
